081_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m037-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"渾邪王","kind":"person","person_id":"164_wmw_9ck","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m037-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"休屠王","kind":"person","person_id":"szo_tqq_qr1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m037-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"渾邪王","kind":"person","person_id":"164_wmw_9ck","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m037-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"休屠王","kind":"person","person_id":"szo_tqq_qr1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m037-0045","start":45,"end":49,"surface":"驃騎將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"3tw_nq2_gyn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m037-0053","start":53,"end":56,"surface":"渾邪王","kind":"person","person_id":"164_wmw_9ck","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m037-0057","start":57,"end":60,"surface":"休屠王","kind":"person","person_id":"szo_tqq_qr1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m037-0083","start":83,"end":86,"surface":"渾邪王","kind":"person","person_id":"164_wmw_9ck","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","book_id":"b-shiji-110","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p011","text":"冠軍侯去病既侯三歲，元狩二年春，以冠軍侯去病為驃騎將軍，將萬騎出隴西，有功。天子曰：「驃騎將軍率戎士踰烏盭，討遬濮，涉狐奴，歷五王國，輜重人眾懾慴者弗取，冀獲單于子。轉戰六日，過焉支山千有餘里，合短兵，殺折蘭王，斬盧胡王，誅全甲，執渾邪王子及相國、都尉，首虜八千餘級，收休屠祭天金人，益封去病二千戶。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m011-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"冠軍侯","kind":"person","person_id":"3tw_nq2_gyn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m011-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"去病","kind":"person","person_id":"3tw_nq2_gyn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m011-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface